{"evidence":[{"pdf_page":49,"quote":"Reckitt's Code of Conduct governs standards of conduct in relation to our employees, as well as our stakeholders. All employees must complete Code of Conduct training and are encouraged to refer to the code frequently to ensure the right decisions are made. In addition, Reckitt has policies committing to equal opportunities at work and to providing a safe and healthy working environment. Health and safety performance is monitored through our Group Occupational Health and Safety Management System, enabling us to investigate any incidents and take any necessary action. We have a Speak Up Policy and process, allowing any employee or third party to confidentially report a violation of the Code of Conduct, local law or regulation, or unethical behaviour.","source_id":"KB-B006-RECKITT-AR2025"}],"knowledge_status":"reference_candidate","predicate":{"canonical_key":"evidence_snippet_health_safety","raw_key":"health_safety"},"promotion":{"eligible":false,"reason":"requires_semantic_projection_and_independent_evidence_gate"},"provenance":{"reference_status":"deterministic_html_table_cell_gap_repair_pending_semantic_projection","simulated":false,"source_artifact":"artifacts/scale_batch_006/mineru_targets_RESUME01/KB-B006-RECKITT-AR2025-p0049/reckitt-annual-report-2025/auto/reckitt-annual-report-2025.md","source_sha256":"cbac115a8eef5c00ffff5613d6940209f986f54d324f70c38af36d67fe349f97"},"qualifiers":{"answer_status":"unverified_evidence_candidate","calculation_expression":null,"normalized_unit":null,"period_literal":"2025","reference_period":2025,"scope_boundary":null,"value_origin":"deterministic_html_table_cell_gap_repair"},"record_id":"fact-3b7c41d8ee1ea88fa528093d","record_kind":"fact","schema_version":"0.1","subject":{"document_ids":["KB-B006-RECKITT-AR2025"],"document_metadata":[{"company":"Reckitt Benckiser Group plc","document_id":"KB-B006-RECKITT-AR2025","language":"English","local_path":"data/raw/scale_batch_006/reckitt-annual-report-2025.pdf","sha256":"f4190b49ca96687386cd877b52aba925bb5bad8fc0efa0c2873ef6eaebbffbd2","title":"Annual Report and Accounts 2025"}],"entity_label":"Reckitt Benckiser Group plc","task_id":"KB-B006-GAP-REPAIR-KB-B006-RECKITT-AR2025-P0049-HEALTH_SAFETY"},"trust_tier":"C","value":"Reckitt's Code of Conduct governs standards of conduct in relation to our employees, as well as our stakeholders. All employees must complete Code of Conduct training and are encouraged to refer to the code frequently to ensure the right decisions are made. In addition, Reckitt has policies committing to equal opportunities at work and to providing a safe and healthy working environment. Health and safety performance is monitored through our Group Occupational Health and Safety Management System, enabling us to investigate any incidents and take any necessary action. We have a Speak Up Policy and process, allowing any employee or third party to confidentially report a violation of the Code of Conduct, local law or regulation, or unethical behaviour."}
